body:
This function and `_move_caret_document_end` both remove all secondary carets, so we don't need to store the initial position of all carets.
It just needs to store the first caret, and if there was more than one.

So it could be:
```suggestion
	PackedVector2Array previous_caret_positions;
	if (get_caret_count() == 1) {
		previous_caret_positions.push_back(Vector2(get_caret_line(0), get_caret_column(0)));
	}
```

